# Sample posts file for Enhanced Twitter Bot (Xbot)
# 
# Format options:
# 1. Plain text (one post per line)
# 2. JSON format for advanced options
#
# Plain text examples:
Hello world! This is my first automated post.
Check out this amazing content I'm sharing today!

# JSON format examples (one JSON object per line):
{"content": "This post has an image attached!", "images": ["data/pictures/image.png"], "community_groups": ["default"]}
{"content": "This post goes to multiple groups", "community_groups": ["tech", "social"], "scheduled_for": "2024-12-01T10:00:00"}

# Comments start with # and are ignored
# Empty lines are also ignored

Another simple text post without any special formatting.

# You can mix plain text and JSON formats in the same file
{"content": "Final post with custom settings", "images": ["path/to/image1.jpg", "path/to/image2.png"], "community_groups": ["default"]}